{"id": "DbBlvLyhNIj", "title": "Video by ryansterling", "description": "Comment DESIRE and I’ll send you a prompt to help you find topics people are already searching for. \n\nThat giant drop-off on your retention graph? Everyone told you it means your hook sucks.\n\nIt doesn’t.\n\nThe graph shows how many people stayed. It doesn’t show why the rest left. And most of the time, they left because the topic was small, not because the hook was weak.\n\nYou can write the best hook in the world. If only 5,000 people care about the topic, that’s your ceiling.\n\nSo before you rewrite the hook for the tenth time, ask a better question: how many people actually want this?", "channel": "ryansterling", "uploader_id": "69798906779", "uploader": "Ryan Sterling", "timestamp": 1784572384, "like_count": 3715, "comment_count": 4675, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-2048073909248211a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 58.925, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQPd6YajOiY4Wu4XblJMrufGjVKk7MKhmLxja_OUmR6o0gcXXqisxU3saglK1ppCGOZ-6DHfGUppbqz72fH-VGvXpsFCzM5gddC7A58.mp4?_nc_cat=111&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-bog2-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=pGAs5qm2qHEQ7kNvwEy4JAU&%3D%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=T-L7pJ2oceI4Ul7IQkqGCQ&_nc_ss=7ba8c&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQPO5bV8SFdUBo_VHHaIuN-2hD_Mbifh27JQ-t569CuEwQ&oe=6AC9B95C", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 58.925, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64)